      },
      {
        "author_name": "David Bass",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108746497777454430660/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIfKWj_GgQCVxgpj_pXn1U91kuiXbMF4vhdBwPv8wR9L1kwww=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We were looking for tiles and could not believe the attentive service we received. The sales person was so patient, helpful, and informative and as well prices were very competitive.\nWhen it came for delivery, the tiles were delivered exactly when expected and again with great service.",
        "time": 1709597988,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jim Muir",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114118049579349177888/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVboZnvofDa1ThwfaQpwjWVZ8bWH1H6wg7xC1UTP9CXqCzQSq2lsQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Extremely helpful staff. We have been looking for flooring at every store possible with no success. The second we walked in we knew we were in the right place. Unlimited choices to choose from. Definitely recommend.",
        "time": 1723493857,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lori Neill",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111470978373046479966/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLF7Xoc5LtFsmqYNs3Shn4bzp70Z2szg_AGTuxX_x7qVp1WLA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent service at the store and superb installation of my kitchen floor by Alain, their installer. Fast, clean, courteous, and an absolutely beautiful job. I will definitely have them back for other work.",
        "time": 1686185807,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Valerie Mitchell",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105436510945961408207/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIhEvYDYppAEq5JEdl4nSQTOv3sbH0V0MWgmDOK0yGJ9PnceQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I went to Plancher Pincourt to choose new flooring for my basement family room after I was referred by someone. The selection was incredible and the staff was very helpful in helping me determine what kind of flooring was best for my needs and budget.\nThey came and installed, did a beautiful job and I’m super happy I went with them. I would highly recommend.",
